      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned agent child process immediately before that process starts**. Specifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the spawned agent\u0027s environment (either the Ingest agent or Query agent)\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated and never holds the key\n\nThis design ensures that a compromised Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting environment variables \u2014 the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually needs to call the Anthropic API.",
